            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 17:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mfuasi myao achikukosera, mlunge ukamkanye mwi airi machiyenu. Achikusikira mundakala mkaphahana, tsona undakala ukamuuyiza njira ya sawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.19.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kumbukumbu 19:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asiphokusikira, hala mutu mmwenga au airi ukale phamwenga nao, ili ‘chila kosa rihakikishwe ni mashaidi airi au ahahu.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achirema kuaphundza, naambirwe afuasi ayae. Achikubali ni vinono, achirema kuaphundza, phahi mtsukurireni dza mutu ambaye si mmwenga wa atu a Mlungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.16.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mathayo 16:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.20.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 20:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuambirani kpweli kukala, chochosi ndichokahaza himu duniani, chindakala chikakahazwa hiko mlunguni, na chochosi ndichokubali himu duniani, chindakala chikakubaliwa hata hiko dzulu mlunguni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona nakuambirani kukala airi ama zaidi hipha duniani achiphahana na kuvoya kuhusu dzambo rorosi, phahi Baba ariye mlunguni andakuhenderani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa mana atu airi ama zaidi achikala phamwenga kpwa sababu ni afuasi angu, nami ndakala phamwenga nao.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
