          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.17.3+LUK.17.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 17:3–4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Petero wamlunga Jesu achendamuamba, “Bwana, mfuasi myangu anikosere kano ngaphi ndipho nisimswamehe? Dze hata kano sabaa?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.4.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mwandzo 4:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jesu achiamba, “Siamba umswamehe kano sabaa bahi, ela mirongo sabaa kano sabaa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ndarira hino inaeleza afuasi angu alondwavyo kuswameheana. Mfalume mmwenga wakata shauri kumanya isabu ya pesaze arizoapha atumishie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ariphoandza kuhenda isabu, wareherwa mutu yekala na deni ra maelufu ga pesa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa vira kala kaweza kuripha rira deni, tajiriwe walagiza aguzwe ye mwenye, mchewe, anae na vitu vyosi arivyokala navyo ili ariphe rira deni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi yuya mtumishi wamgbwerera maguluni tajiriwe na achimuamba, ‘Bwana, nivumirira nami nindakuripha deniro rosi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho yuya tajiri achimuonera mbazi yuya mtumishiwe achimswamehe rira deni, chisha achimricha achiphiya vyakpwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela yuyatu mtumishi ariyeswamehewa deni, ariphouka, wakutana na mtumishi myawe ambaye kala anamdai pesa chache. Phahi wamgbwira umiro na achimuamba, ‘Niripha deni rangu!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiye mtumishi myawe wagbwa chimabumabu, achimuamba, ‘Nivumirira nami nindakuripha!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela ye warema, achendamtiya jela myawe hadi ndiphoripha rira denire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phahi hinyo atumishi anjina ariphoona mambo higo, asononeka sana, na achendasema na tajiri wao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuya tajiri wamuiha yuya mtumishi na achimuamba, ‘Uwe u mtumishi mui sana! Wanivoya nikuswamehe, nami nchikuswamehe deniro rosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dze, che si sawa kumuonera mbazi mtumishi myao dza nrivyokuonera mbazi?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi yuya mfalume watsukirwa sana, achimlavya kpwa asikari a jela akatiwe adabu hadi ndiphoripha denire rosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 18:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimarigizo Jesu waamba, “Naye Baba ariye mlunguni andakuhenderani vivyo chila mmwenga ambaye kandamswamehe mfuasi myawe moyo kutsuka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.18.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.18.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
